{"name":"Aquatone","hex":"#a6b5a9","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"aquatone","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An offset printing method using a gelatin-coated zinc plate to print type, line illustrations, and fine-screen halftones.","A print produced by this method."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/aquatone"}],"entries":[{"title":"Collotype","blocks":[{"text":"Collotype is a gelatin-based photographic printing process invented by Alphonse Poitevin in 1855 to print images in a wide variety of tones without the need for halftone screens. The majority of collotypes were produced between the 1870s and 1920s. It was the first form of photolithography."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Bayerische_Landes-Industrie-%2C_Gewerbe-_und_Kunst-Ausstellung_N%C3%BCrnberg_1882%2C_Bildpostkarte%2C_Foto_Lichtdruck_Johann_Baptist_Obernetter.jpg/330px-Bayerische_Landes-Industrie-%2C_Gewerbe-_und_Kunst-Ausstellung_N%C3%BCrnberg_1882%2C_Bildpostkarte%2C_Foto_Lichtdruck_Johann_Baptist_Obernetter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collotype","wikidata":"Q1572315"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Frankfurt_Am_Main-Alte_Oper_von_Suedosten-um_1900.jpg/500px-Frankfurt_Am_Main-Alte_Oper_von_Suedosten-um_1900.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Frankfurt_Am_Main-Alte_Oper_von_Suedosten-um_1900.jpg/1280px-Frankfurt_Am_Main-Alte_Oper_von_Suedosten-um_1900.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Frankfurt_Am_Main-Alte_Oper_von_Suedosten-um_1900.jpg/500px-Frankfurt_Am_Main-Alte_Oper_von_Suedosten-um_1900.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Postcard o